                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 0.0, 315.0, 966.0, 93.0 ],
                                    "text": "3. Gen and sample accurate patching are fully supported in RNBO but MC and ABL objects are not.\n"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontsize": 24.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 0.0, 191.0, 975.0, 122.0 ],
                                    "text": "2. Object attributes can be fixed or dynamic, with fixed attributes set when the RNBO patcher is compiled, either inside rnbo~ or when exporting to an export target, and dynamic attributes being modifiable when the RNBO patch is running.\n"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 0,
                                    "fontsize": 24.0,
                                    "id": "obj-4",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 0.0, 96.0, 993.0, 93.0 ],
                                    "text": "1. RNBO exclusively uses floating points and so, while message boxes are supported, symbols and variable messages using $ are not.\n"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontface": 1,
                                    "fontsize": 36.0,
                                    "id": "obj-3",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 0.0, 0.0, 674.0, 94.0 ],
                                    "text": "Key differences between RNBO and Max:\n"
                                }
                            }
                        ],
                        "lines": []
